                                                "sense_id": "52fae208-ec2a-32d8-875c-ef48ead82693",
                                                "text": "The mind feeds upon the body: pale sickness, and early decrepitude, overmaster even its spiritual essence. Too late it discovers that this earth is its prison, and not its home: the heart beats, and its pulses are the clockwork of wretchedness:..."
                                            }
